The proposition-level approach resolves this by ensuring each retrieval unit is **atomic, self-contained, and contextually grounded**—i.e., it expresses *one distinct fact* and incorporates *all necessary context* (e.g., coreference resolution) to be interpretable independently, thereby reducing ambiguity and improving precision.",ok,"(%)
