MAKING RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED LANGUAGE
MODELS ROBUST TO IRRELEVANT CONTEXT
Ori Yoran1
Tomer Wolfson1,2
Ori Ram1
Jonathan Berant1
1Tel Aviv University, 2Allen Institute for AI
