It was actually Pettigrew who betrayed the Potters and staged his own death to frame Sirius Black.
3.
When Sirius Black escaped from prison, he was initially believed to be hunting down Harry to kill him for revenge.
4.
However, it was later revealed that Sirius Black actually wanted to kill Pettigrew to get revenge for framing him and
betraying the Potters.
