3], and high probability is > 2
3. ∆indicates
the improvement in accuracy when using retrieval. For NQ and 2WIKIMQA, many cases where
retrieval is helpful have low entailment probability. For the implicit STRATEGYQA most examples
have low entailment, but retrieval helps in the few examples with medium entailment.
