We chose a diverse set of data sets to demonstrate that dropout is a general technique
for improving neural nets and is not speciﬁc to any particular application domain. In this
section, we present some key results that show the eﬀectiveness of dropout. A more detailed
description of all the experiments and data sets is provided in Appendix B.
