𝑟𝑡𝑒𝑥𝑡(𝑞,𝑑) and 𝑟𝑣𝑖𝑠𝑖𝑜𝑛(𝑞,𝑑), respectively, with a smoothing hyper-
parameter 𝑘. In our implementation, we set 𝑘= 0, diverging from
